# ESP-IDF generated files
**/build*/
**/managed_components/
**/dependencies.lock
**/sdkconfig.old
**/gdbinit/

# Keep checked-in sdkconfig defaults, but ignore local generated configurations
**/sdkconfig
!**/sdkconfig.defaults
!**/sdkconfig.defaults.*

# Editors and tooling
**/.vscode/

# Documentation and package output
**/doxygen_output*/
**/doxygen*/
**/dist/

# Python cache
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
